Yes, we can use the Levenshtein distance algorithm to find the closest matching synonyms for each given word. The Levenshtein distance is a measure of the difference between two strings, which is defined as the minimum number of single-character edits (insertions, deletions, or substitutions) required to change one word into the other.
Here is a MATLAB code that uses the Levenshtein distance algorithm to find the closest matching synonyms for each given word:
```matlab
% Define the list of words and synonyms
words = {'Play', 'Laugh'};
synonyms = {{'Game', 'Sport', 'Recreation'}, {'Giggle', 'Chuckle', 'Snicker'}};
% Loop over each word and find the closest matching synonyms
for i = 1:length(words)
    word = words{i};
    syns = synonyms{i};
    distances = zeros(length(syns), 1);
    for j = 1:length(syns)
        syn = syns{j};
        distances(j) = levenshteinDistance(word, syn);
    end
    [~, idx] = sort(distances);
    closest_syns = syns(idx(1:2)); % choose the top 2 closest matching synonyms
    fprintf('For the word "%s", the closest matching synonyms are: %s\n', word, strjoin(closest_syns, ', '));
end
function distance = levenshteinDistance(str1, str2)
    m = length(str1);
    n = length(str2);
    d = zeros(m+1, n+1);
    for i = 1:m+1
        d(i, 1) = i-1;
    end
    for j = 1:n+1
        d(1, j) = j-1;
    end
    for j = 2:n+1
        for i = 2:m+1
            if str1(i-1) == str2(j-1)
                d(i, j) = d(i-1, j-1);
            else
                d(i, j) = min([d(i-1, j), d(i, j-1), d(i-1, j-1)]) + 1;
            end
        end
    end
    distance = d(m+1, n+1);
end
```
The output of this code will be:
```
For the word "Play", the closest matching synonyms are: Game, Sport
For the word "Laugh", the closest matching synonyms are: Giggle, Chuckle
```
Note that the `levenshteinDistance` function is used to calculate the Levenshtein distance between two strings. This function is called for each synonym of each word to find the closest matching synonyms. The `strjoin` function is used to join the closest matching synonyms into a string with commas.

